This message is unlikely to be related to the crash (but I will investigate 
it). My best guess is that once again a wrong version of the rkward R library 
is getting picked up (one from a previous installation of an older version). 
Please try running

# R CMD REMOVE rkward

*several times* until you get a message that no "rkward" library could be 
found. Do this both as root and as regular user. Now install rkward again.

If this does not help, run rkward with

# rkward --debug-level 5 2> debuglog

, zip up the resulting file "debuglog", and post it (preferrably to 
rkward-devel at lists.sourceforge.net to keep traffic on this list low).

Regards
Thomas
