Yes, that causes the problem. However, the fix should be as simple as running 
the "cmake" command again, before make.

(Acutally we don't use any symbols from libRblas in rkward. We only link 
against it when present, as there have been strange problems with failed 
symbol lookups at runtime in the past, without this. Since Dirk is CCed: 
Maybe you have an idea on this?)

Regards
Thomas
